        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-706, Rope Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe rope detailing of the Double Rope Edge Cabinet Knob is a time-loved favorite for its simple yet classic design. Almost every manufacture has their own version of a rope knob, but only a few translate the design to cabinet hardware. This beautiful cabinet pull is available in 1-1/2 inch diameter and a 1-1/2 inch diameter. Choose any of 6 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International Rope Edge Cabinet Hardware:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-706:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-705:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
